      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَبْهَبٌ</span></b>  A wolf that is <i>light,</i> or <i>active, and quick,</i>
or <i>swift, of pace.</i> (K.) See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَبْهَبِىٌّ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>A certain
valley of hell, the place of abode of tyrants,
oppressors, and the like.</i> (TA, from a trad.)

